OL,3,GNEWSA'World feels less bright' - fans
OL,4,Aand musicians on island of Ireland
OL,5,Amourn Dolly parting
OL,6,
OL,7,FFrom young readers to the the musicians
OL,8,Fshe met and inspired, there have been a
OL,9,Fchorus of tributes from across Northern
OL,10,FIreland and the Republic.
OL,12,FLondonderry-born singer Mairead Carlin
OL,13,Fis one of those who took their cue from
OL,14,Fthe legacy of Dolly, and even had the
OL,15,Fopportunity to meet someone she
OL,16,Fdescribed as "beautiful inside and
OL,17,Fout".
